      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCY LOU (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 520m behind Zipping Alcaraz (33.63) in a Maiden. Was in the money prior to that. Form from her last run is proving strong. Looks the one to beat on her best form. SCARBOROUGH PEST (2) placed three back at Capalaba then out of the placings last couple but moves to box 2 this time where she has performed well. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. HOOKED ON DOLLY (5) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 1.3 lengths (35.34). Expected to feature again. POZZI TONOZZI (3) should be thereabouts.",
